	(text_box "Nordic network: C6 returns to VSS_PA on the TOP layer only. C9 returns to the BOTTOM ground layer only (net tie NT2). Place the whole network as close to the ANT pin as possible. (nRF54L15 datasheet, Fig 180 and Table 87)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 96.52 0) (size 100 8.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "edad735a-fcc5-4e17-a8e8-8c7d6668d37d"))
	(text_box "Antenna tee: 0R, empty, 0R as a start (R2, C14, R3). The antenna is the Johanson 2450AT18A0100001E in a corner with its keep-out. Tune on the worn band with the final housing. Pin 2 is only a solder anchor. Johanson's own evaluation board uses series 1.0 pF, shunt 2.7 nH, series 3.9 nH: the shunt slot may need an inductor, so the 0402 slot C14 is a generic shunt element." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 149.86 96.52 0) (size 100 12.2) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 200 0 0 1)) (fill (type color) (color 160 195 245 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bd7e8f67-2d1d-4ad3-b498-7a4814bc5dbe"))
